# new-odyssey-cip

Python package for the Common Infrastructure Protocol monorepo.

It provides:

- control-plane record types
- repository abstractions
- in-memory repositories
- a `CipControlPlane` service
- an OpenAI Agents SDK adapter via `create_cip_control_plane_agent`
